<title>POLAND: Animex ups stake in Mazury to 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Animex ups stake in Mazury to 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish food trader Animex SA increased its stake in the Zaklady Miesne Mazury w Elku SA meat plant to 65.3 percent from 55 percent by taking over 280,000 of its registered shares, Animex said in a statement.</p>
<p>Mazury's new share issue has raised the company's share capital by 2.8 million zlotys to 25.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
